sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as MEDITECH
  participant VIP as VIP 10.0.10.10
  participant E1 as edge1 gateway
  participant E2 as edge2 gateway
  participant N as NATS (edge1-3)
  participant A as lab-api
  M->>VIP: ORU^R01 (MLLP :7890)
  VIP->>E1: (VIP is on edge1)
  E1->>N: publish (3 replicas)
  N-->>E1: stored
  E1-->>M: ACK AA
  E1->>A: POST (HTTPS)
  A-->>E1: 200
  Note over E1: edge1 powers off
  Note over VIP: keepalived on edge2: edge1 silent, VIP moves (about 4-6 s)
  M->>VIP: reconnect, resend what had no ACK
  VIP->>E2: (VIP is on edge2)
  E2->>N: publish (edge2 and edge3 are a majority)
  E2-->>M: ACK AA
  E2->>A: POST (HTTPS)
  A-->>E2: 200
